	  subject: "Case Law",
	  points: 1,
	  prompt: "According to Dyar v. State (2003), what must a peace officer be able to do to justify a warrantless arrest involving suspicious places and circumstances under Code of Criminal Procedure Art. 14.03?",
	  options: [
